      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a solid start for the security side. one more thing—we're also worried about the 'chaos factor' of having 500 people in one space. it's easy for things to feel unmanaged or for small issues to snowball. can you suggest a way to structure 'incident logging' so the management team can track these small disruptions in real-time without it becoming a huge distraction for the service staff?",
